WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Komorebi

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:10.000
Read. Your mail, one message at a time.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Reply. Write, format, send. Nothing else asks for you.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Rest. Nothing new. Komorebi waits in the corner, quietly.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:27.000
The inbox in Komorebi 1.0.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Unread is a solid spot. Read mail turns quiet.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Sent. The seal appears once, then it is gone.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Komorebi. Read. Reply. Rest. Free for Windows 10 and 11.
